---
layout: layouts/blog-shell.njk
pageTitle: Writing | 申名翀 Ethan
pageDescription: 记录产品现场、AI 实践，以及那些暂时没有结论的想法。
pagination:
  data: blog.posts
  size: 20
  alias: pagePosts
  generatePageOnEmptyData: true
permalink: "blog/{% if pagination.pageNumber > 0 %}page/{{ pagination.pageNumber | plus(1) }}/{% endif %}index.html"
---
<section class="writing-hero" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
  <div>
    <p class="writing-kicker" data-i18n="blog.hero.kicker">现场笔记 · ETHAN SMC</p>
    <h1 id="writing-title" data-i18n="writing.title">写作</h1>
    <p data-i18n="writing.description">记录产品现场、AI 实践，以及那些暂时没有结论的想法。</p>
  </div>
  <aside class="writing-index-note" aria-label="写作类型说明" data-i18n-aria-label="blog.legendAria">
    <span><i class="legend-dot legend-dot--essay"></i><b data-i18n="blog.essayLegend">长文 · 展开的判断</b></span>
    <span><i class="legend-dot legend-dot--note"></i><b data-i18n="blog.noteLegend">随记 · 当下的片段</b></span>
  </aside>
</section>

{% if blog.tags.length %}
  <nav class="tag-filter" aria-label="按标签筛选文章" data-i18n-aria-label="blog.filterAria" data-tag-filter-nav>
    <a class="active" href="/blog/" data-tag-filter="all" aria-current="page"><b data-i18n="blog.all">全部</b> <span>{{ blog.posts.length }}</span></a>
    {% for tag in blog.tags %}
      <a href="{{ tag.url }}" data-tag-filter="{{ tag.normalized }}">#<b data-i18n-authored="{{ tag.label | escape }}">{{ tag.label }}</b> <span>{{ tag.count }}</span></a>
    {% endfor %}
  </nav>
{% endif %}

<section class="field-log" aria-label="写作时间线" data-i18n-aria-label="blog.timelineAria" data-field-log>
  {% if pagePosts.length %}
    {% for postItem in pagePosts %}
      {% set entry = postItem %}
      {% include "partials/blog-entry.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
    <div class="writing-empty">
      <span aria-hidden="true">✎</span>
      <h2 data-i18n="blog.emptyTitle">第一篇还在纸上。</h2>
      <p data-i18n="blog.emptyBody">文章发布后，会自动出现在这条时间线上。</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% if pagination.pages.length > 1 %}
  <nav class="blog-pagination" aria-label="文章分页" data-i18n-aria-label="blog.pagesAria">
    {% if pagination.href.previous %}<a href="{{ pagination.href.previous }}" data-i18n="blog.newer">← 更新的记录</a>{% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
    <span>{{ pagination.pageNumber | plus(1) }} / {{ pagination.pages.length }}</span>
    {% if pagination.href.next %}<a href="{{ pagination.href.next }}" data-i18n="blog.older">更早的记录 →</a>{% endif %}
  </nav>
{% endif %}
